          %title Contents
          %blockquote
            %p
              This article is about of groups of Witt vectors and rings of Witt vectors; which are often called just Witt groups and Witt rings. However, there is also a different notion of
              %span.newWikiWord
                Witt group
                %a{:href => "/nlab/new/Witt+group"} ?
              and
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Witt+ring"} Witt ring
